{c: Verse 1}
[Em] [A] [Asus4] [A]
[Em]Breathe, breathe in the,        [A]air [Asus4] [A]
[Em]Dont be afraid to [A]care,        [Asus4] [A]
[Em]Leave but dont leave [A]me,        [Asus4] [A]
[Em]Look around and choose your,        [A]own ground [Asus4] [A]
For [C]long you live and high you fly,        And [Bm]smiles youll give and tears
youll cry,        [F]All you touch and all you see
Is [G]all your [G7]life will [Bb]ever be,        [Em]Run, rabbit [A]run [Asus4] [A]
